 address memory and retrospective meaning but not unobserved detail. Type narrows it further: a private letter can address personal reaction, a public notice can address intended message, and an official record can address what an institution tracked, so Account A as a private letter and Account B as a public notice are each suited to different questions. Purpose adds one more limit: a source made to persuade can address what its maker wanted readers to do, and its own claims can be used only with suspicion, which is why the persuasive aim behind Account B\\'s public notice changes how its statements should be treated.\"}'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '1 validation error:\\n```json\\n[\\n  {\\n    \"type\": \"missing\",\\n    \"loc\": [\\n      \"response\"\\n    ],\\n    \"msg\": \"Field required\"\\n  }\\n]\\n```\\n\\nFix the errors and try again.'}], 'model': 'deepseek-flash', 'max_completion_tokens': 8000, 'stream': False}, 'extra_json': {'thinking': {'type': 'disabled'}}}"}
