hen draws a one-sentence limit on what this account can address. Ask the learner which description is stronger and what specifically the strong one does that the weak one does not. Do not present the weak description as merely wrong \\\\u2014 it is incomplete, and the incompleteness is the point. Do not use this block to re-explain the four features.\",\\n      \"evidence\": \"The contrast slot requires a case and a near-miss side by side, and the near-miss here is a date-only description, which is the visible form of M2; placing them together lets the learner see the boundary of a complete analysis rather than only hear the rule.\",\\n      \"id\": \"contrast-b1\",\\n      \"intent\": \"compare\",\\n      \"sourcebook_refs\": []\\n    },\\n    \"terminology\": [\\n      \"primary source\",\\n      \"claim\",\\n      \"evidence\",\\n      \"author\",\\n      \"date\",\\n      \"purpose\",\\n      \"perspective\",\\n      \"bias\",\\n      \"corroboration\",\\n      \"limitation\",\\n      \"support\"\\n    ]\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nReturn JSON only for this capability payload.'}, {'role': 'system', 'content': 'Return only valid JSON matching this schema.\\nDo not call tools.\\n{\"properties\": {\"response\": {\"additionalProperties\": true, \"type\": \"object\"}}, \"required\": [\"response\"], \"type\": \"object\", \"title\": \"dict\"}'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': 'Return JSON only for the selected capability payload.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '{\\n  \"kind\": \"table\",\\n  \"headers\": [\\n    \"Description\",\\n    \"What it says about Account A\"\\n  ],\\n  \"rows\": [\\n    [\\n      \"Weak description (date only)\",\\n      \"Account A is dated close to the event. Because it is close to the event, it tells us what happened.\"\\n    ],\\n    [\\n      \"Strong description (all four features)\",\\n      \"The author of Account A is (named / unknown); known about the author: their role or position relative to the event is (statement); unknown about the author: (statement). The date places the account (contemporary with / later than) the event, so it could observe (statement) but could not observe (statement). Account A is a (type of source), which typically records (statement). The author\\'s stated purpose, or the purpose the account carries implied, is (statement). One-sentence limit: this account can address (statement).\"\\n    ]\\n  ],\\n  \"caption\": \"Two descriptions of Account A side by side: the weak description is incomplete, not merely wrong, while the strong description uses all four features to draw a limit on what the account can address.\"\\n}'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': '1 validation error:\\n```json\\n[\\n  {\\n    \"type\": \"missing\",\\n    \"loc\": [\\n      \"response\"\\n    ],\\n    \"msg\": \"Field required\"\\n  }\\n]\\n```\\n\\nFix the errors and try again.'}], 'model': 'deepseek-flash', 'max_completion_tokens': 8000, 'stream': False}, 'extra_json': {'thinking': {'type': 'disabled'}}}"}
